We will be slowly applying 230 volt.
我们慢慢加到 230 伏。

148
00:08:40,210 --> 00:08:46,050
You can have an observation.
你们可以观察。

149
00:08:46,050 --> 00:08:50,050
So you have to see the lower scale because I have connected to 300 volt.
要看下面的刻度，因为我接的是 300 伏量程。

150
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:52,050
Therefore, you are supposed to see the lower scale.
所以要看下面的刻度。

151
00:08:52,050 --> 00:08:54,050
Here you need to measure the line current.
这里需要测量线电流。

152
00:08:54,570 --> 00:09:00,280
Line current has to be measured.
线电流需要测量。

153
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,280
At the same time, you are supposed to measure the phase current.
同时还要测量相电流。

154
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:07,970
Phase current also needs to be measured.
相电流也需要测量。

155
00:09:07,970 --> 00:09:09,970
You can see the brightness of the lamp.
你们可以看到灯泡的亮度。

156
00:09:09,970 --> 00:09:12,970
Though you are applying less voltage, bulb is getting brighter.
虽然施加的电压较低，灯泡却越来越亮。

157
00:09:12,970 --> 00:09:16,970
Once you have taken the reading, autotransformer will bring back to initial position.
读完数后，把自耦变压器调回初始位置。

158
00:09:16,970 --> 00:09:19,970
So readings have to be tabulated.
读数要填入表格。

159
00:09:19,970 --> 00:09:24,250
Okay, so we have done the demonstration.
好，演示做完了。

160
00:09:24,250 --> 00:09:29,880
Finally, we will be learning the relation between star and delta connection.
最后，我们来了解星形和三角形连接的关系。

161
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:33,400
So in case of star connection, line current and phase current will be equal.
对于星形连接，线电流和相电流相等。

162
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:36,400
Then line voltage is equal to root 3 times phase voltage.
线电压等于根号 3 倍的相电压。

163
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,400
That can be verified.
这一点可以验证。

164
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:41,400
In case of delta connection, line current is equal to root 3 into phase current.
对于三角形连接，线电流等于根号 3 乘以相电流。

165
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:44,400
But the line voltage and phase voltage will be equal.
而线电压和相电压相等。

166
